          "stats": {
            "id": "levelled_description_8f0e0ede5b23",
            "level": {
              "value": 4
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You enter a tight stance, coiled up like a lashing cobra with your hands poised as venomous fangs. While in this stance, the only Strikes you can make are cobra fang unarmed attacks.\n\nThese deal 1d4 poison damage; are in the brawling group; and have the agile, deadly d10, finesse, nonlethal, poison, and unarmed traits.\n\nWhile in Cobra Stance, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Fortitude saves and your Fortitude DC, and you gain poison resistance equal to half your level."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
